OL,3,GNEWSADoctor regrets not going to police
OL,4,Aearlier about Lucy Letby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior doctor who raised suspicions
OL,7,Fabout Lucy Letby has said he should
OL,8,Fhave gone to police sooner.
OL,10,FDr Stephen Brearey was the lead
OL,11,Fneonatal consultant at the Countess of
OL,12,FChester Hospital when the nurse
OL,13,Fmurdered seven babies and attempted to
OL,14,Fmurder seven others.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
