OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADoctor regrets not going to police
OL,4,Aearlier about Lucy Letby
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his first interview since the
OL,7,Fpublication of the Thirlwall Inquiry
OL,8,Freport into what happened, Brearey
OL,9,Freflected on the effect on staff and
OL,10,Fsaid he had "naively" assumed senior
OL,11,Fmanagers would respond to suspicions
OL,12,Fabout the nurse's involvement in a
OL,13,Fseries of baby deaths.
OL,15,FThe inquiry found a "toxic negativity"
OL,16,Fwithin the NHS that continued to
OL,17,Fdiscourage staff from speaking out,
OL,18,Fdespite stronger whistleblowing
OL,19,Fguidance, and said regulation was
OL,20,Flacking.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
